Acting under Chapter VII of the Charter of the United Nations,
1. Condemns in the strongest terms all terrorist activities and attacks by ISIL/Da’esh, its affiliates, the East Turkestan Islamic Movement (ETIM) as designated by the Security Council, and all other terrorist groups in Syria designated by the Security Council, and demands that all such groups immediately cease all terrorist acts, recruitment, financing and planning;
